  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID support for Kailash Sacred Landscape Conservation and Development Initiative (ICIMOD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity DFID support for Kailash Sacred Landscape Conservation and Development Initiative (ICIMOD) is a component of South Asia Water Governance Programme (SAWGP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;5,095,983. This project benefits Asia, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Tourism policy and administrative management, Environmental policy and administrative management, Democratic participation and civil society, Water resources conservation (including data collection).</narrative>
  </description>
